  description="The 5 best barefoot shoes of 2026, ranked on toe room, a flat sole, grip, sizing risk and price. Xero, Vivobarefoot, Merrell and WHITIN vs our #1 barefoot shoe under $70."
  h1="Best 5 Barefoot Shoes 2026"
  h2='30+ Shoes <span class="ul">Ranked Head-to-Head</span>'
  updated={UPDATED}
  byline={{ name: "Daniel Strutgate", photo: "/images/authors/daniel-strutgate.webp", checkedBy: "Deals Desk" }}
  intro={[
    '<span class="hg">We did the hard work for you</span> – we compared 30+ of the best-selling barefoot shoes, hunting for the pair that ends <b>end-of-shift foot ache, crushed toes and the $200 gamble</b>. We scored everything from <b>toe-box shape and heel drop</b> to <b>sole grip, sizing risk and price</b>.',
    '<span class="hr">We didn\'t just read the box</span> – we read hundreds of verified buyer reviews and <b>50+ owner threads</b> from people on hard floors all day: nurses, retail, warehouse, trades. The goal? The pair you can wear <b>from clock-in to clock-out and still want a walk after dinner</b>, not kick off the second you get home.',
  ]}
  verdictLine="Our #1 overall: Grounded Footwear Freedom, 9.8/10, now up to 60% off ›"
  chips={["30+ Shoes Compared", "4.8★ from 13,427+ Buyer Reviews", "90-Day Money-Back"]}
  listLede='Here are our <span class="ul">Top 5 Barefoot Shoes</span>, with <a href="#review">a full review of our #1 pick further down:</a>'
  products={products(seg)}
  bandLabel='Best Barefoot Shoe in <span class="yr">2026</span>'
  stamp="<span><b>#1</b>EDITORS' CHOICE 2026</span>"
  review={{
    heading: "Review of the Grounded Footwear Freedom Barefoot Shoes",
    image: { src: "/images/gfr/gfr-core-concrete.webp", alt: "Man standing on a concrete store floor in black Grounded Footwear Freedom barefoot shoes", w: 800, h: 800, caption: "Made for long days on hard floors." },
    html: reviewHtml(seg),
  }}
  where={where(seg)}
  side={side(seg)}
  author={{
    name: "Daniel Strutgate",
    role: "Footwear & Everyday Comfort Editor · 9 years on a hardware-store floor",
    photo: "/images/authors/daniel-strutgate.webp",
    html: "<p>We compared over 30 barefoot and minimalist shoes this year, and the <b>Grounded Footwear Freedom</b> was the clear #1 for all-day wear. It's <b>widest at the toes, zero drop and slip-resistant</b>, and it costs less than one pair of the shoes it beat.</p><p>I ran a hardware-store floor for nine years on concrete in thick, “wide” shoes and kicked them off in the truck every night. If you want a <b>light, foot-shaped shoe under $70 with free size exchanges</b>, this one's a no-brainer.</p>",
  }}
  disclosure={DISCLOSURE}
  dealCalendar={DEAL_CALENDAR}
  rollingSaleEnd={ROLLING_SALE_END}
  topUrl={GF_LINK}
  sticky={sticky}
>
  {CPV_CAMPAIGN && <Fragment slot="body-end"><CpvTracker campaign={CPV_CAMPAIGN} lp="2" /></Fragment>}
</ReviewPageRip>
